      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Looks a battle between the two Emma Stewart runner. CASTERTON (7) is really delivering now and made it three wins on the trot when he came from the back row and worked but dug deep to land the Golden Nursery Final last start. Draws wide but is unbeaten at this circuit and distance so is good enough to overcome the barrier and score again. AUSTON (6) hasn't raced since the Vicbred Super Series where he placed in both his heat and a semi-final at Melton. Readied with a trial and and won his only other fresh attempt. CHAMPAGNE PROBLEMS (9) led and fought well when just edged out by CASTERTON last week. Tougher draw but can get into the finish again. ONE AUSSIE (3) is next best from a fair draw.",
